            "review_title": "Review at Phung Kiều",
            "review_text": "Bandit-One\nLucerne, Switzerland12007 contributions\n0\nGood for a quick bite\nOct 2025 • Couples\nAfter browsking through the Ben Thanh Market we were a bit hungry. And since it was raining we decided to grab a bite right here in the market.\n\nEven though not mainly a food market, there is a good number of food stalls offering vietnamese classics. And they fight hard for customers, but if you chose to ignore that, you will find some cheap and cheerful lunches here. Decided to have lunch here. Staff was nice, food displayed looked good and interesting items on the menu.\n\nOrdered a bowl of Pho, Banh Xeo (pancake with fillings), and pork sausages. Even though probably not the most exciting Pho, it was enjoyable. And the pork sausages were actually very delicious. The Banh Xeo was nice and crispy. I would call it cheap and cheerful. Excactly what we looked for, a quick enjoyable meal. And it was. And at good value.\nRead more\nWritten November 29, 2025",
